	bdsk-url-1 = {http://geology.gsapubs.org/content/early/2014/04/08/G35271.1.abstract%20N2%20-%20%20The%20Keweenawan%20Midcontinent%20Rift%20of%20North%20America%20records%20significant%20continental%20rifting%20between%20ca.%201110%20and%201085%20Ma,%20and%20preserves%20the%20most%20detailed%20paleomagnetic%20record%20of%20plate%20motion%20of%20any%20continent%20in%20Precambrian%20time.%20U/Pb%20dates%20from%20extrusive%20and%20intrusive%20rocks%20of%20the%20western%20Lake%20Superior%20Basin%20suggest%20a%20latent%20stage%20of%20reduced%20magmatic%20activity%20from%20ca.%201106%20to%201100%20Ma%20that%20places%20constraints%20on%20the%20dynamics%20of%20rift%20development%20and%20the%20record%20of%20plate%20motion.%20However,%20it%20has%20remained%20unclear%20whether%20this%20stage%20is%20a%20feature%20of%20the%20entire%20%3E2500-km-long%20rift.%20The%20succession%20of%20picritic%20and%20basaltic%20lava%20flows%20at%20Mamainse%20Point%20in%20the%20eastern%20Lake%20Superior%20Basin%20may%20be%20the%20most%20continuous%20and%20best%20exposed%20record%20of%20rift-related%20volcanism%20and%20magnetic%20reversals,%20but%20its%20age%20and%20duration%20relative%20to%20the%20latent%20stage%20has%20been%20uncertain%20due%20to%20a%20lack%20of%20radioisotopic%20dates.%20We%20present%20a%20weighted%20mean%20206Pb/238U%20date%20of%201100.36%20%C2%B1%200.25%20Ma%20on%20zircon%20crystals%20isolated%20from%20a%20newly%20discovered%20tuff%20within%20the%20upper%20reversed%20polarity%20portion%20of%20the%20stratigraphy%20below%20the%20Great%20Conglomerate.%20This%20date%20indicates%20that%20eruptive%20activity%20at%20Mamainse%20Point%20continued%20during%20the%20interval%20of%20diminished%20magmatic%20activity%20in%20the%20western%20Lake%20Superior%20Basin.%20This%20result%20strengthens%20the%20chronostratigraphic%20framework%20of%20rift%20development%20while%20explaining%20the%20preservation%20of%20additional%20geomagnetic%20reversals%20at%20Mamainse%20Point%20and%20the%20record%20of